{
  "about": [
    "The pack's dimensions and their tier: ONE entry per dimension, read by every script that asks about dimension tiers",
    "(kubejs/server_scripts/0_lib_registry.js -> icraft.dims) and by the dev tools (dev/rosters).",
    "How to add a dimension, what each key means and which script reads it: dev/rosters/README.md.",
    "After any edit: python .minecraft/dev/rosters/validate.py  (the pre-push hook runs it).",
    "tier 1-4. stageGate = the AStages restriction id; the dimension is locked until the player has stage tier_<tier>.",
    "exploration = the key of the first-arrival token bonus (it is part of a saved player flag: never rename one).",
    "deathPenalty = share of durability lost on death there. mobEquipment = the gear roll for mobs that spawn there.",
    "flags: loot (member of its tier's group in the tiered loot rules), classPassives (standing there raises the",
    "player's detected tier for the class passives).",
    "The ORDER of the entries is the order scripts hand a tier's dimensions on (loot conditions, stage gates).",
    "Strict JSON, no comments. Every id must be a dimension the server has."
